BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Flow into Friday Yoga with Bre
DTSTART;TZID=MDT;VALUE=DATE-TIME:20260626T083000
DTEND;TZID=MDT;VALUE=DATE-TIME:20260626T093000
UID:0266ac31bf98dc6fd172138ed1689cc8@wellnesscollectivemoab.com
DESCRIPTION:A gentle and grounding way to move mindfully into your weekend
 . Start your Friday with this all-levels yoga class designed to help you a
 wa ken the body\, center the mind\, and ease into your day with intention.
  We’ ll begin with slow\, fluid movement to energize and open\, followed
  by long er-held stretches and restorative postures to help you release te
 nsion and reconnect with yourself. This class is inclusive\, beginner-frie
 ndly\, and rooted in breath\, balance\, and compassionate movement. Whethe
 r you’re unw inding from your week or preparing for the weekend ahead\, 
 Friday Flow is a chance to show up just as you are.
LOCATION:Wellness Collective\, 76 S 100 W\, Moab\, UT 84532
X-SOURCE:Wellness Collective Moab
END:VEVENT
