BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Chair Yoga with Breann
DTSTART;TZID=MDT;VALUE=DATE-TIME:20260629T090000
DTEND;TZID=MDT;VALUE=DATE-TIME:20260629T100000
UID:beb573d5482396d4deab088cdff92e5f@wellnesscollectivemoab.com
DESCRIPTION:Chair Yoga – Mondays at 9 AM Join us every Monday morning at
  9:00 AM for a gentle and accessible Chair Yoga class\, led by Breann\, a 
 ce rtified trauma-sensitive yoga teacher and experienced massage therapist
 . Breann brings over 20 years of experience in guiding others toward great
 er body awareness\, healing\, and relaxation. This class is designed for e
 very one – whether you are new to yoga\, have limited mobility\, or are 
 looking for a mindful and soothing way to start your week. Chair Yoga allo
 ws you to experience the benefits of yoga without needing to get down on a
  mat. Wha t to Expect: • Seated and standing postures using the chair fo
 r support • G entle stretches to enhance flexibility • Breathing exerc
 ises to calm the mi nd and body • Movements to promote better circulatio
 n and balance ✨ No exp erience necessary – come as you are! Where: Wel
 lness Collective When: Ever y Monday at 9:00 AM Cost: By donation Let this
  practice be a moment of sel f-care and grounding in your week.
LOCATION:Wellness Collective\, 76 S 100 W\, Moab\, UT 84532
X-SOURCE:Wellness Collective Moab
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Intro to Mind series with Dana
DTSTART;TZID=MDT;VALUE=DATE-TIME:20260630T070000
DTEND;TZID=MDT;VALUE=DATE-TIME:20260630T074500
UID:1ffdfc0422874d904b9e23f8ace8d967@wellnesscollectivemoab.com
DESCRIPTION:Intro to Mind (ITM): A 9-Week Meditation Series with Dana This
  nine-week mind science series invites you to slow down\, notice\, and ste
 ady your mind — especially in the face of uncertainty. Together\, we ’
 ll explore meditation in a practical\, approachable way. Each week explore
  s simple tools you can use in daily life — when sitting\, moving\, and 
 conn ecting with others. Over nine weeks\, we’ll also explore how water\
 , food\, sleep\, music\, movement\, stillness\, community\, and meditation
  shape ho w we live and how we experience the world — in a supportive co
 mmunity of fe llow practitioners. The series is divided into three parts: 
 Weeks 1–3: Mind at Rest During these weeks\, we’ll focus on finding mo
 ments of rest and steadiness in the space between thoughts an d in the fac
 e of sensations and emotions — especially when life feels busy or uncert
 ain.
LOCATION:Wellness Collective\, 76 S 100 W\, Moab\, UT 84532
X-SOURCE:Wellness Collective Moab
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Chair Yoga @ the Grand Center-Bre
DTSTART;TZID=MDT;VALUE=DATE-TIME:20260630T143000
DTEND;TZID=MDT;VALUE=DATE-TIME:20260630T153000
UID:897a66e2cbbff62ec9db8eee9134cb2f@wellnesscollectivemoab.com
DESCRIPTION:Join us every Tuesday afternoon at 2:30 PM at the Grand Center
  for a gentle\, accessible Chair Yoga class led by rotating Wellness Colle
 ct ive yoga instructors. Each teacher brings their own style and expertise
 \, w hile sharing a common focus on safety\, choice\, and ease in the body
 . T his class is especially supportive for older adults and anyone who pre
 fers to stay off the floor\, has limited mobility\, uses a chair for stabi
 lity\, or is simply looking for a calm\, nourishing way to move. All poses
  are do ne seated or standing with the support of a chair\, so you can exp
 erience t he benefits of yoga without getting down on a mat.
LOCATION:Grand Center\, 182 N 500 W\, Moab\, UT 84532\, USA
X-SOURCE:Wellness Collective Moab
END:VEVENT
