DTEND;TZID=MDT;VALUE=DATE-TIME:20260702T104500
UID:4c32cccc8cb6ec29ef5f6c4adb04ffa1@wellnesscollectivemoab.com
DESCRIPTION:This 45-minute resistance band strength class is for adults 70
 + who want to build strength\, improve balance\, and stay active in a supp
 or tive\, small-group setting. Classes focus on simple\, low-impact moveme
 nts that support everyday mobility and confidence. Exercises are adaptable
  and meet participants where they are. Resistance bands are provided or yo
 u’r e welcome to bring your own. Please wear comfortable clothing\, stab
 le shoe s\, and bring a water bottle. Thursdays at 10:00 AM at Wellness Co
 llecti ve $10 per class To sign up\, text Susette at 435-260-2523. Or show
  up !
LOCATION:Wellness Collective\, 76 S 100 W\, Moab\, UT 84532
X-SOURCE:Wellness Collective Moab
END:VEVENT
