BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Dharma Recovery with Jan
DTSTART;TZID=MDT;VALUE=DATE-TIME:20260702T183000
DTEND;TZID=MDT;VALUE=DATE-TIME:20260702T193000
UID:ab80646f86d999ff2d20b3005e442cb6@wellnesscollectivemoab.com
DESCRIPTION:Join Tom for Dharma Recovery-a peer-led community space that i
 s unified by our trust in the potential of each of us to recover and find 
 fr eedom from the suffering of addiction. We believe that the traditional 
 Budd hist teachings\, often referred to as the Dharma\, offer a powerful a
 pproac h to healing from addiction and living a life of true freedom. Clas
 s is fre e.
LOCATION:Wellness Collective\, 76 S 100 W\, Moab\, UT 84532
X-SOURCE:Wellness Collective Moab
END:VEVENT
