DTEND;TZID=MDT;VALUE=DATE-TIME:20260805T181500
UID:1b39ea85a7390640969503468d233841@wellnesscollectivemoab.com
DESCRIPTION:The yoga of 12-Step recovery. Combining the practical tools of
  the 12-Step program with the ancient wisdom of yoga. Y12SR is a yoga prac
 ti ce followed by a brief group discussion based on the 12-steps. Open to 
 ever yone and anyone dealing with their own addictive behavior or affected
  by th e addictive behavior of others. This is an open and inclusive group
 . All A’ s are welcome. Y12SR is NOT a replacement for meetings\, sponso
 r\, or a par t of the 12-step program. Free class provided in partnership 
 with USARA.
LOCATION:Wellness Collective\, 76 S 100 W\, Moab\, UT 84532
X-SOURCE:Wellness Collective Moab
END:VEVENT
