 \\ \, community setting. Led by Rob\, a licensed acupuncturist and naturop
 athic physician\, this group offering is designed to promote relaxation\, 
 balanc e the nervous system\, and support whole-person wellness. During ea
 ch sess ion\, participants will receive gentle acupuncture while resting c
 omfortabl y in a reclined position. Treatments are tailored to common conc
 erns such a s stress\, anxiety\, fatigue\, sleep disturbances\, and emotio
 nal overwhelm . No prior experience is needed\, and Rob will walk you thro
 ugh the process so you feel at ease. Group acupuncture makes this powerful
  healing modali ty more accessible and affordable—while also allowing fo
 r shared healing en ergy in community.
